{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/css/input-number/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>HTML input type 속성은 하나의 타입만 허용한다.<br>\nnumber나, password냐<br>\n둘 중 하나를 골라야 한다. 그런데 숫자만 입력 받고, 모바일에서 숫자 키패드가 뜨고, 비밀번호로 표시하고 싶다면?</p>\n<h2 id=\"모바일에서-숫자-키패드가-뜨고-비밀번호로-표시하고-싶다면\" style=\"position:relative;\">모바일에서 숫자 키패드가 뜨고, 비밀번호로 표시하고 싶다면?<a href=\"#%EB%AA%A8%EB%B0%94%EC%9D%BC%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EC%88%AB%EC%9E%90-%ED%82%A4%ED%8C%A8%EB%93%9C%EA%B0%80-%EB%9C%A8%EA%B3%A0-%EB%B9%84%EB%B0%80%EB%B2%88%ED%98%B8%EB%A1%9C-%ED%91%9C%EC%8B%9C%ED%95%98%EA%B3%A0-%EC%8B%B6%EB%8B%A4%EB%A9%B4\" aria-label=\"모바일에서 숫자 키패드가 뜨고 비밀번호로 표시하고 싶다면 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>input</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">type</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>number<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">inputmode</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>numeric<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>input-number-password<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.input-number-password</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">-webkit-text-security</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> disc<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>type=“number”는 숫자 인풋이다.</li>\n<li>inputmode=“numeric” 모바일 디바이스에서 일반 키패드 대신 숫자 키패드를 띄운다.</li>\n<li>class=“input-number-password” 웹킷 힌트를 준 클래스를 적용했다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>-webkit-text-security 값으로는 disc 말고도 square나 circle 등이 올 수 있으나, disc가 가장 일반적인 패스워드 표시 형식이다. (검게 칠한 동그라미)</p>\n<h2 id=\"모바일-키패드-숫자로-표시하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">모바일 키패드 숫자로 표시하기<a href=\"#%EB%AA%A8%EB%B0%94%EC%9D%BC-%ED%82%A4%ED%8C%A8%EB%93%9C-%EC%88%AB%EC%9E%90%EB%A1%9C-%ED%91%9C%EC%8B%9C%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"모바일 키패드 숫자로 표시하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>input</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">type</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>password<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">inputmode</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>numeric<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">pattern</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>[0-9]*<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<h5>참고</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://server0.tistory.com/74\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">input type number를 비밀번호로 표시하기</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Global_attributes/inputmode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">inputmode</a></li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#%EB%AA%A8%EB%B0%94%EC%9D%BC%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EC%88%AB%EC%9E%90-%ED%82%A4%ED%8C%A8%EB%93%9C%EA%B0%80-%EB%9C%A8%EA%B3%A0-%EB%B9%84%EB%B0%80%EB%B2%88%ED%98%B8%EB%A1%9C-%ED%91%9C%EC%8B%9C%ED%95%98%EA%B3%A0-%EC%8B%B6%EB%8B%A4%EB%A9%B4\">모바일에서 숫자 키패드가 뜨고, 비밀번호로 표시하고 싶다면?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EB%AA%A8%EB%B0%94%EC%9D%BC-